UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>CQUniversity''''s Master of Business Administration (MBA) is world-class and is delivered by highly qualified course leaders with real-world business and public sector experience to support your career advancement. Our MBA will develop your management expertise beyond the fundamentals of running organisations, focusing on leading and managing people with integrity and effective change management, underpinned by contemporary emotional intelligence models. </p><p>Our highly functional and highly ranked MBA ensures you will study contemporary people management and emotional intelligence models to lead with influence and integrity. Designed for emerging and aspiring leaders, our MBA has been designed with the for-purpose sector in mind and focuses on developing contemporary people management skills with the know-how to tackle the changing landscape of the public sector, not-for-profit, social and ethical purpose organisations.</p><p>Develop your skills and knowledge in a broad range of management and leadership responsibilities, in areas such as strategy, marketing, people management, operations management, economic and change management, and choose a major to suit your industry or career goals. </p><p>Tailor your MBA to align with your industry or career and choose to major in emergency management, forensic analysis, project management or general management.</p><p>Through interaction with academics, colleagues and various members of the business community, you will gain different perspectives and approaches to current and emerging business issues. Contextual learning and reflective practice forms the basis for your personal and professional development to ensure your learning experience is relevant and practical.</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 78,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 57960,
    onshore_tuition_fee = 49950,
    apply_form = 'https://www.cqu.edu.au/courses/cl20/master-of-business-administration',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE cricos_course_code = '095945J';
UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>CQUniversity’s Master of Business Management is designed for current and aspiring managers to develop strong business acumen, financial literacy and excellent interpersonal skills to progress in their management careers. With a solid foundation in management topics and the option to specialise in a range of fields, you will be well equipped to strategically manage organisations in the modern business environment across any sector.</p><p>This course is ideal for new or experienced managers who want to build on their current business knowledge and gain advanced knowledge of business management and a complementary discipline to suit their industry or career goals.</p><p>Throughout the course, you''''ll delve into discipline-specific core units that are designed to prepare you for the practical management of modern businesses. You''''ll study a diverse range of core units, from management and effective business communications to human resource management, marketing, managerial finance, and accounting for decision-making. Additionally, you''''ll benefit from a professional practice and career development unit that builds your understanding of contemporary perspectives on professional practice and allows for self-analysis and self-reflective practice in relation to your personal development needs.</p><p>As a student in this course, you can enjoy the opportunity to gain specialist knowledge in an area that complements your interests or career goals. You can choose from five majors, including emergency and health services management, human resource management, international business, leading organisational change, and marketing.</p><p>Your learning is enhanced throughout the course through a combination of face-to-face and online discussions and examinations of workplace case studies.</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 104,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 77280,
    onshore_tuition_fee = 66528,
    apply_form = 'https://www.cqu.edu.au/courses/cl21/master-of-business-management',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE cricos_course_code = '095946G';
