UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>The Master of Sustainable Development is designed for professionals seeking to become leaders in the field of sustainability. This comprehensive course offers a holistic approach to sustainability, encompassing environmental, social and economic dimensions.</p><p>In this postgraduate sustainability degree, you will delve into advanced topics, including sustainable resource management, policy analysis and corporate sustainability strategies. You will build and advance your understanding of sustainability in areas such as emergency and disaster management, community engagement and resource management, climate change, demography, business sustainability, public health and more. This extensive coverage will equip you with a robust and multi-faceted understanding of sustainable development.</p><p>A distinctive feature of this course is the practical residential school, where you will gain hands-on skills and insights from industry experts. This immersive experience allows you to apply theoretical knowledge to real-world challenges, enhancing your practical understanding of sustainable practices. The curriculum is designed to foster innovative solutions and critical thinking, preparing graduates to drive sustainable development agendas, influence policy and implement impactful initiatives in diverse sectors globally.</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 104,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 73680,
    onshore_tuition_fee = 65000,
    apply_form = 'https://www.cqu.edu.au/courses/cm82/master-of-sustainable-development',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE cricos_course_code = '117526J';
UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>If you''''re a professional aiming to enhance your expertise, the Graduate Diploma of Sustainable Development will prepare you to lead sustainability initiatives within organisations, communities, and industries.</p><p>This postgraduate sustainability degree offers a comprehensive exploration of sustainability principles and practices, equipping you to address complex environmental challenges and promote sustainable development across various sectors. The course covers key themes in environmental sustainability, including climate change adaptation, sustainable resource management, and environmental policy.</p><p>You will also explore broader aspects of sustainability, such as social equity, economic viability, and governance frameworks. You will gain critical skills and knowledge through interdisciplinary coursework and case studies to develop and implement effective sustainability strategies.</p><p>You will graduate will the skills, knowledge and capability to integrate sustainable practices into your professional roles, drive positive environmental outcomes, and contribute to the broader goals of sustainable development.</p><p>The Graduate Diploma of Sustainable Development is ideal as a standalone postgraduate qualification in sustainable development or as a stepping stone towards advanced studies in sustainability such as CQU''''s <a href="/courses/master-of-sustainable-development">Master of Sustainable Development</a>.</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 52,
    offshore_tuition_fee = 36840,
    onshore_tuition_fee = 33300,
    apply_form = 'https://www.cqu.edu.au/courses/cm83/graduate-diploma-of-sustainable-development',
    updated_at = NOW()
WHERE cricos_course_code = '117530B';
UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>The Graduate Certificate in Sustainable Development offers a comprehensive introduction to the core principles and practices of sustainability within a global framework. </p><p>Designed to equip professionals with the expertise to address complex environmental challenges, the course delves into the interconnected social, economic, and governance aspects of sustainability. You will explore key areas such as sustainable development, environmental management, and policy strategies through four interdisciplinary units. This sustainable development course provides a strong foundation ideal for expanding your skills and making a meaningful impact in sustainability-focused roles across diverse industries.</p><p>The Graduate Certificate in Sustainable Development is part of a suite of postgraduate courses in this field, making it ideal as a standalone postgraduate qualification in sustainable development or as a stepping stone towards advanced studies in sustainability such as CQU''''s <a href="/courses/1200379/graduate-diploma-of-sustainable-development">Graduate Diploma of Sustainable Development</a> and <a href="/courses/master-of-sustainable-development">Master of Sustainable Development</a>.</p>',
