    course_description = '<p>The Diploma of Creative Media at CQU offers foundational training for a range of entry-level roles in the media and communications industry.</p><p>Your course builds essential skills and theoretical knowledge that can be applied to a variety of fields associated with design, technology and media.</p><p>Tailor your studies to suit your individual strengths and interests, with a choice of minors. You will choose three minors from:</p><p>Learn more about each minor in the Structure &amp; Availability section below.</p><p>During your course, you will learn how to create digital media works using industry-standard software tools and techniques, whilst also learning to think critically, solve problems, communicate effectively, and work independently and collaboratively on practical projects. </p>',
